==Description==
The '''Korblox Soul''' was an enemy that only appeared in the [[Huevous Hunt]] as part of [[The Hunt Event]]. It had a decent amount of health and above average speed. Additionally, it was a hidden enemy, while on some waves, also a lead enemy, reducing the amount of towers that could kill it. On some waves, it also gained the stun, freeze and burn immunities.

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox Soul''' had blue skin. It did not have a head, torso or legs, though it did have a rib cage. It wore a grey helmet, grey cloth around waist and had chains wrapped around its arms. It also had multiple blue spikes on its shoulders.

==Strategy==
*Towers like the [[Pyromancer]] and [[Shotgunner]] can be quite effective against the '''Korblox Souls'''
**As the '''Korblox Soul''' gains the [[Burn Immunity]] on some waves, the [[Pyromancer]] is going to be weaker against it, as it cannot deal burn damage to a burn immune '''Korblox Soul'''.
*Later on, the [[Minigunner]] and [[Accelerator]] can clear out hordes of '''Korblox Souls''' quickly.
**As both of these towers have lead detection, they can also be useful when it becomes a lead enemy.

